# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Repository-wide ignores.
#
#  ⚠️ LOCKFILES ARE NOT IGNORED, ON PURPOSE. `package-lock.json` and
#  `Cargo.lock` are what make a build in a year's time resemble a build
#  today, and this project ships a binary to schools that will not be
#  rebuilt often. If you find yourself wanting to ignore one, you want to
#  commit it instead.
#
#  ⚠️ `*.xlsx` IS NOT IGNORED EITHER. `packages/engine/fixtures/*.xlsx` are
#  the reference workbooks the fixture gate compares against, byte for
#  byte. Ignoring spreadsheets would silently delete the only proof this
#  project produces the right file.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Node
node_modules/
.npm/
npm-debug.log*

# Build output. `dist/timetable.html` at the repo root is a build artefact,
# not a source file — the release workflow rebuilds it from the front-end.
dist/
build/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Rust
target/

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Local environment
.env
.env.local
